{"unit_id":"tag:06GW:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是诺特环（Noetherian ring），且<MATH_0002>是有限环映射（finite ring map），其中<MATH_0003>是域（field）。我们定义<TEXTITOPEN_0001><MATH_0004><TEXTITCLOSE_0001>\n为如下范畴（category）\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 对象（objects）是对<MATH_0005>，其中<MATH_0006>是诺特（Noetherian）的完备（complete）局部（local）<MATH_0007>-代数（algebra），且<MATH_0008>是\n<MATH_0009>-代数（algebra）同构（isomorphism），以及\n<STRUCT_0003> 态射（morphisms）<MATH_0010>是局部（local）<MATH_0011>-代数（algebra）\n同态（homomorphisms），使得<MATH_0012>。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Noetherian ring","target_term":"诺特环"},{"source_term":"finite ring map","target_term":"有限环映射"},{"source_term":"field","target_term":"域"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"Noetherian","target_term":"诺特"},{"source_term":"complete","target_term":"完备"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部"},{"source_term":"algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部"},{"source_term":"algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"homomorphisms","target_term":"同态"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Noetherian ring","target_term":"诺特环","context":"基环的有限生成性质；待决定。"},{"source_term":"finite ring map","target_term":"有限环映射","context":"有限环同态；待决定。"},{"source_term":"field","target_term":"域","context":"剩余域；待决定。"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"完备基范畴定义；待决定。"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象","context":"范畴对象；待决定。"},{"source_term":"Noetherian","target_term":"诺特","context":"局部代数的诺特性；待决定。"},{"source_term":"complete","target_term":"完备","context":"极大理想拓扑的完备性；待决定。"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部","context":"局部代数与局部同态；待决定。"},{"source_term":"algebra","target_term":"代数","context":"基环上的代数；待决定。"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"剩余域识别；待决定。