{"unit_id":"tag:06GV:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n如定义<REF_0001>之后的讨论，\n我们通常将<MATH_0001>的对象（object）\n简记为<MATH_0002>，并默认为已作识别<MATH_0003>。\n本节讨论范畴（category）<MATH_0004>的对象（objects）和态射（morphisms）的一些基本性质，\n与上一节对范畴（category）<MATH_0005>的讨论相对应。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n我们的第一个观察是，任何对象（object）<MATH_0006>\n都是<MATH_0007>的对象（object），因为阿廷（Artinian）局部环（local ring）\n总是诺特（Noetherian）的，并且关于其极大理想（maximal ideal）完备（complete）\n（该理想毕竟是幂零理想（nilpotent ideal））。此外，由\n定义清楚可知，\n<MATH_0008>\n是由所有阿廷环（Artinian rings）组成的严格满子范畴（strictly full subcategory）。\n反过来，实际上<MATH_0009>的每个对象（object）\n都是<MATH_0010>的对象（objects）的极限（limit）。\n\n<STRUCT_0004><STRUCT_0005>\n设<MATH_0011>是<MATH_0012>的对象（object）。\n考虑<MATH_0014>所对应的环（rings）<MATH_0013>。\n这些都是诺特局部环（Noetherian local rings），有唯一的幂零素理想（nilpotent prime ideal），因而\n是阿廷（Artinian）的，见\n代数（Algebra），命题<REF_0002>。\n环映射（ring maps）\n<MATH_0015>\n均为满射（surjective）。<MATH_0016>的完备性（Completeness）按定义意味着\n<MATH_0017>。若<MATH_0018>是<MATH_0019>中的环映射（ring map），\n则我们得到环映射（ring maps）的系统\n<MATH_0020>，其极限（limit）为给定映射（map）。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"Artinian","target_term":"阿廷"},{"source_term":"local ring","target_term":"局部环"},{"source_term":"Noetherian","target_term":"诺特"},{"source_term":"maximal ideal","target_term":"极大理想"},{"source_term":"complete","target_term":"完备"},{"source_term":"nilpotent ideal","target_term":"幂零理想"},{"source_term":"Artinian rings","target_term":"阿廷环"},{"source_term":"strictly full subcategory","target_term":"严格满子范畴"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"limit","target_term":"极限"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"sou