{"unit_id":"tag:06GZ:proof","translation":"注意，对<MATH_0001>，相对余切空间（relative cotangent spaces）有等式\n<MATH_0002>，\n对<MATH_0003>也类似。因此由\n引理<REF_0001>\n可知，对所有<MATH_0005>，<MATH_0004>均为满射（surjective）。\n现在设<MATH_0006>为<MATH_0007>的核（kernel）。则序列\n<MATH_0008>\n构成有向逆系统（directed inverse systems）的正合列（exact sequence）。系统<MATH_0009>\n满足Mittag-Leffler条件（Mittag-Leffler），因为每个<MATH_0010>都是阿廷（Artinian）的。因此由\n代数（Algebra），引理<REF_0002>，\n取极限（limits）保持正合性（exactness）。所以\n<MATH_0011>为满射（surjective），即<MATH_0012>为满射（surjective）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"relative cotangent spaces","target_term":"相对余切空间"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"kernel","target_term":"核"},{"source_term":"directed inverse systems","target_term":"有向逆系统"},{"source_term":"exact sequence","target_term":"正合列"},{"source_term":"Mittag-Leffler","target_term":"Mittag-Leffler条件"},{"source_term":"Artinian","target_term":"阿廷"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"limits","target_term":"极限"},{"source_term":"exactness","target_term":"正合性"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"relative cotangent spaces","target_term":"相对余切空间","context":"相对余切空间的复数词形；待决定。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"诱导映射；待决定。"},{"source_term":"kernel","target_term":"核","context":"环映射的核；待决定。"},{"source_term":"directed inverse systems","target_term":"有向逆系统","context":"用于取逆极限的有向系统；待决定。"},{"source_term":"exact sequence","target_term":"正合列","context":"逆系统中的正合列；待决定。"},{"source_term":"Mittag-Leffler","target_term":"Mittag-Leffler条件","context":"原文形容词用法指该条件；待决定。"},{"source_term":"Artinian","target_term":"阿廷","context":"阿廷性使逆系统满足条件；待决定。"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数","context":"引用代数章；待决定。"},{"source_term":"limits","target_term":"极限","context":"取逆极限；待决定。"},{"source_term":"exactness","target_term":"正合性","context":"取逆极限保持正合性；待决定。"}],"notes":[]}
